OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fdying away from the east through the
OL,7,Fevening, to leave a largely dry but
OL,8,Fincreasingly cloudy night. Brisk
OL,9,Fwesterly winds easing overnight as
OL,10,Fthey back to the southwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FWindy. Many dry through to
OL,13,Fmid-afternoon with some early
OL,14,Fbrightness in east. Patchy rain in far
OL,15,Fwest building and extending to rest of
OL,16,Fthe area late afternoon to early
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
